{30}{Your first roll is special. If the total on the two dice that you roll adds up to SEVEN or ELEVEN on the first throw you win instantly. If you roll a TWO you lose instantly. If you don't win or lose on your first throw, the number that you rolled is SET as a MARK.}{Your first roll is special. If the total on the two dice that you roll adds up to SEVEN or ELEVEN on the first throw you win instantly. If you roll a TWO you lose instantly. If you haven't haven't won or lost on your first throw, the number that you rolled is set as a mark.}{}{}{}{ } 
